    "instructions": "Tailor governance to complexity, uncertainty, impact and team size. Explain why each register or control is useful. Keep actual steps and dates in the canonical Workflow, and link existing resources instead of duplicating them. Use Fields for concise metadata and the titled Rich text objects for detailed content. Required Fields describe expected information; incomplete drafts may be saved. Ask for missing facts when needed; never invent people, dates, references or results. References identify sources and do not grant access. These Fields do not change Workmap execution state.",
